※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 3008 LANG_ASSIGN_EXPECTED_ARROW

※ '=' does not assign.  It is reserved for comparison, so the habit every other
※ language teaches is answered with the rule rather than with a parse error.
@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    let status: mut = 3u8
    status = 5u8
    status
